Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FoggyIntersectionIntersection" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle .

:weather1 a :FoggyCondition .

:risk1 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Vehicle crossing intersection in low visibility conditions" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.92"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Lane Intrusion Risk - Other vehicle is entering the intersection and potentially the ego-vehicle's path while visibility is severely restricted by fog and rainy conditions.
Severity Score: 0.75